sequenceDiagram
    participant User as External User
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant TAS as TrustyAI Service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant TASCtrl as TAS Controller
    participant KServe as KServe InferenceService<br/>6443/TCP (k8s API)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant LMESCtrl as LMES Controller
    participant LMESPod as LMEvalJob Pod<br/>18080/TCP HTTP
    participant S3 as S3/OCI Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant EvalHub as EvalHub Container<br/>8444/TCP HTTP
    participant PgSQL as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant MLflow as MLflow Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,TAS: Flow 1: TAS KServe InferenceService Integration
    User->>Route: POST /v2/models/{model}/infer<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Route->>KRBP: Reencrypt TLS<br/>8443/TCP
    KRBP->>KRBP: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    KRBP->>TAS: Forward (localhost)<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    TASCtrl->>K8sAPI: Patch InferenceService<br/>Add Logger spec<br/>SA token auth
    KServe->>TAS: Prediction payload (logger)<br/>443/TCP TLS<br/>service-serving-cert

    Note over User,S3: Flow 2: LMEvalJob Execution
    User->>K8sAPI: Create LMEvalJob CR<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Bearer token
    LMESCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Pod<br/>SA token auth
    K8sAPI-->>LMESPod: Pod scheduled
    LMESCtrl->>LMESPod: exec → /GetStatus<br/>18080/TCP HTTP<br/>(pod-internal)
    LMESPod->>LMESPod: Run lm-evaluation-harness
    LMESPod->>S3: Upload results<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>AWS/registry credentials
    LMESCtrl->>LMESPod: exec → /Shutdown<br/>18080/TCP HTTP

    Note over User,MLflow: Flow 3: EvalHub Multi-Tenant Request
    User->>Route: POST /api/evaluations<br/>443/TCP HTTPS<br/>X-Tenant header
    Route->>KRBP: Reencrypt TLS<br/>8443/TCP
    KRBP->>KRBP: TokenReview + SAR<br/>+ X-Tenant validation
    KRBP->>EvalHub: Forward (loopback)<br/>8444/TCP HTTP
    EvalHub->>PgSQL: Query/store results<br/>5432/TCP<br/>Optional TLS<br/>Username/password
    EvalHub->>MLflow: Track experiment<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS<br/>Projected SA token
    EvalHub-->>KRBP: Response
    KRBP-->>Route: Encrypted response
    Route-->>User: JSON Response
